BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f096f1ce-c80e-3dc4-89e2-d207aa45f336.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
